207
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:44,000
Perhaps it opened a path between worlds.

208
00:26:44,000 --> 00:26:54,000
Or perhaps one participant spent the ceremony trying to behave normally while becoming convinced that the wooden bowl knew their name. We cannot recover the

209
